[{"answer":"Vegetables are very good for you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/1.mp3"},{"answer":"They say that you should have three servings of vegetables every day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I like green peas. Peas come in pods.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I also like snow peas. You eat the pods on the snow peas.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I like corn when it is on the cob.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Carrots are good to eat raw.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Beans are good for you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/7.mp3"},{"answer":"There are many different types of beans.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/8.mp3"},{"answer":"There are string beans, kidney beans, baked beans and lots of other types of beans.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people don't like green vegetables like broccoli and Brussels sprouts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I like broccoli and Brussels sprouts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/11.mp3"},{"answer":"You can make a salad and put lots of different vegetables into the salad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/12.mp3"},{"answer":"In my salads, I like lettuce, tomatoes, celery,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/13.mp3"},{"answer":"cucumber, radishes, cauliflower and spring onions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I try to have a salad with dressing on it every day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/15.mp3"},{"answer":"My dad likes root vegetables like beets and parsnips.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/16.mp3"},{"answer":"My brother will only eat potatoes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/17.mp3"},{"answer":"He likes his potatoes baked.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/18.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother likes to buy her vegetables at the market.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/19.mp3"},{"answer":"She says they are fresher there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/20.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother buys a lot of onions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/21.mp3"},{"answer":"She puts onions in almost all the meals that she cooks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Some children won't eat their vegetables.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I didn't like some vegetables at first,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/24.mp3"},{"answer":"but I have become used to them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I like having vegetables with my meals.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/50-vegetables-2019-03-29-10-19-55/26.mp3"}]
